    Opened the moment wave 58 closed. ONE card, and the second slot of the
    owner's cap of 2 is deliberately empty: CARD-295, CARD-296, CARD-297 and
    CARD-298 all declare src/nonogram/admin/book_pdf_generator.py, a declared
