active:
  - id: CARD-294
    phase: implementation
    at: 2026-10-25
    branch: card/294-interior-drawing-vocabulary
    worktree: /Users/omelnikova/PycharmProjects/PythonProject4-card-294
    fork_point: 9b0d245d
    agent: "general-purpose, NOT the python-pro agent -- config.yml's own caveat records that the agent of that name in this environment is scoped to another project's FastAPI/SQLAlchemy services. Spawned with no model override: there is no models: block, and the session model may be stronger than the profile's heavy."
    the_one_risk: >-
      The card prices the phase's ONE unpriced primitive. The spike drew lines,
      rectangles, fills and text and never a round shape, so curves (cubic
      Beziers via `c`; PDF has no circle operator) are the only interior
      primitive nobody has emitted. AC-3 demands the price -- lines, operators
      per shape, accuracy at the real printed dot size -- and "awkward and more
      expensive than expected" is an ALLOWED outcome and the reason this card
      runs first rather than fourth.
    branch_name_corrected: "I created card/294-vector-drawing-vocabulary and the card's Branch: field said card/294-interior-drawing-vocabulary. The branch was renamed to match the card, not the reverse: decompose wrote the field and every consumer reads it."

